  "title": "Minute Chocolate Mug Cake",
  "description": "A tasty, quick mug cake dessert to make when you&#39;re in the mood for a gooey, chocolate treat in mere minutes — with coconut, almonds, and chips.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
